                "text": "This shutdown was completely avoidable\u2014and the only ones who lost were the American people.\n\nFamilies should never be used as bargaining chips. Children should never be on the brink of hunger. Those who are sick should never face financial ruin to get healthcare. Federal workers should never have to work without pay.\n\nWe need leaders who will come to the table and work for the American people. It\u2019s time to get back to work!",
