                "text": "The American people are struggling. \n\nThey\u2019re struggling to put food on the table, to pay their rent, and now finding out  that their healthcare is doubling and tripling heading into the holidays. \n\nIt\u2019s time to get back to work on the issues affecting the American people and not covering up the Epstein Files!",
