                "text": "60,000 private sector jobs were lost during the shutdown. Let that sink in. That is on top of the hundreds of thousands who were furloughed.\n\n60,000 who lost their ability to put food on the table because the GOP would rather play political games than negotiate a healthcare fix. That is outrageous.\u00a0It\u2019s time to get back to work and address the healthcare needs of millions of Americans!",
