                "text": "EDUCATION is a policy choice. Just like ensuring HEALTHCARE and fighting HUNGER are a policy choice.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nNew Mexico has chosen as a state to ensure our communities have access to all three\u2014including as the first state to guarantee universal early childhood education and free college for all.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nBut, these promises are based on having a system that works for all Americans.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nAnd every day, this Administration is breaking more of these systems, including in education. \n\nThat is why we must keep fighting! \n\nhttps://t.co/JCFMjetE4D",
