                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Friends\u2014there\u2019s 10 days until Congress leaves for the holidays and a LOT is happening\u2014from the Epstein files, to the NDAA, healthcare, and a slough of GOP \u201cpermitting\u201d bills that would gut environmental protections, to bills we are introducing to protect the environment, restore the Clean Water Act, rebuild the federal service, and tackle some of our biggest challenges. There\u2019s a lot on tap! \u2b07\ufe0f",
