                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This is amazing news for our neighbors in Albuquerque! \n\nHealthcare is a human right. Everyone deserves access and care, regardless of their circumstances.  \n\nI\u2019m so grateful to the UNM medical team who is doing this vital work on the ground. https://t.co/tHQMCmqTQj",
