                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Speaker Johnson\u2019s decision to NOT allow even a vote on ACA subsidies is a slap in the face to every American who will see their healthcare skyrocket on January 1st.\n\nHardworking Americans deserve healthcare that won\u2019t send them into crisis or crippling debt. But once again, it\u2019s clear that the House GOP does not seem to care about the lives and well-being of hardworking Americans.",
