                "retweet_count": 912,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Well, it\u2019s Tuesday night and there\u2019s all kinds of tea here on Capitol Hill. From the Speaker refusing to allow a vote on a healthcare extension, to the White House Chief of Staff dishing on Trump and Epstein, to the Admin\u2019s efforts to defend illegal strikes off the coast of Venezuela, and ongoing attacks on the environment, our communities, and the rule of law.\n\nIt\u2019s all a lot. But, we keep showing up and doing the work. \u2b07\ufe0f",
