                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Speaker has canceled votes tomorrow and refused to hold a vote on extending the Affordable Care Act. And what did my colleagues use their last remaining hours on the floor to do?\n\nAttack healthcare for low-income LGBTQ+ kids. One week from Christmas, and two weeks before millions of Americans lose support for healthcare\u2014and this is what they used their precious floor time for. Pathetic.",
